  "question": "Can a small OpenDreamer tokenizer and action-conditioned dynamics model complete data collection, training, and held-out multi-frame rollout on CoinRun?",
  "reason": "Frame reconstruction alone does not demonstrate a world model; the action-conditioned latent dynamics and rollout path needed an end-to-end test.",
  "hypothesis": "A 545,920-parameter dynamics model trained for 15,000 steps will produce finite, temporally continuous 16-frame held-out rollouts.",
  "falsification": "Trainer failure on CoinRun actions, rollout failure, non-finite metrics, or visually collapsed/static predictions.",
